\section{Introduction}

This report is a data analysis conducted on the restaurants.dat database provided by the Swiss Link market research institute. It includes information on 1033 individuals who participated in a survey that contained 18 questions relating to various aspects of restaurants. Each question is a single variable concerning common aspects of food, service, and atmosphere.
The analysis will focus on the variable \texttt{g27a}, which measures general satisfaction with the restaurant and the impact the other observed variables have on it. It will also try to graph the correlation and structure of the remaining variables, discussing the missing values (NAs) 


\section{Statistical Analysis}

