The results clearly show that\\
- \textbf{Cluster 1 (catering)} has a very strong positive linear effect on the outcome with incredibly high significance.\\
- \textbf{Cluster 2 (food)} has a strong positive linear effect (though lower than catering) and is highly significant.\\
